WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:00.000 --> 00:01.000
MkvDrama.net

3
01:30.566 --> 01:31.551
=Tigers Sniff the Rose=

4
01:31.551 --> 01:33.560
(Based on the novel of the same name by Yiren Kuikui)

5
01:35.260 --> 01:38.940
=Episode 28=

6
01:40.220 --> 01:43.020
Grand Princess Luling secretly colluded with the treacherous eunuch Yu Cheng'an,

7
01:43.380 --> 01:44.420
set up a private mourning hall,

8
01:44.540 --> 01:45.500
and defiled the Imperial Palace.

9
01:45.820 --> 01:47.020
She has scorned the teachings of our ancestors

10
01:47.340 --> 01:48.540
and dishonored the Imperial Shrine.

11
01:48.900 --> 01:50.580
She is hereby deprived of the revenues from 3,000 enfeoffed households

12
01:50.820 --> 01:52.180
and confined to a residence outside the city

13
01:52.300 --> 01:53.260
to reflect on her faults.

14
01:53.620 --> 01:55.380
Without imperial decree, she may not enter court

15
01:55.580 --> 01:56.500
or visit the imperial tombs.

16
01:56.740 --> 01:57.820
Let this serve as a lasting warning.

17
01:58.100 --> 01:59.060
Let it be carried out.

18
02:29.700 --> 02:30.380
Mr. Wei Qiao.

19
02:30.860 --> 02:31.380
Do you think

20
02:32.100 --> 02:33.620
His Majesty really means to exile us?

21
02:34.460 --> 02:35.220
Is he

22
02:35.780 --> 02:36.780
really that heartless?

23
02:46.620 --> 02:47.620
People from Sheng'an are here!

24
02:48.060 --> 02:49.300
Maybe they're here to pardon us.

25
02:49.660 --> 02:51.060
I told you His Majesty wouldn't be that cruel.

26
02:51.580 --> 02:52.100
Let's go.

27
02:52.340 --> 02:52.620
Come on.

28
02:55.340 --> 02:56.140
Gentlemen,

29
02:56.420 --> 02:57.300
you've had a long journey.

30
02:58.180 --> 02:59.420
His Majesty granted you wine and food.

31
03:00.260 --> 03:02.660
Please eat and drink your fill

32
03:03.100 --> 03:03.980
before you set off.

33
03:05.220 --> 03:06.300
So it's just a meal.

34
03:08.380 --> 03:08.700
Never mind.

35
03:09.180 --> 03:10.020
At least there's food.

36
03:10.340 --> 03:11.180
I'm parched anyway.

37
03:12.660 --> 03:12.940
Let's go.

38
03:15.020 --> 03:16.500
Didn't expect such a feast.

39
03:17.420 --> 03:17.980
And wine too.

40
03:29.700 --> 03:31.020
Mr. Wei, have a drink.

41
03:32.140 --> 03:32.620
Xianyao.

42
03:34.820 --> 03:35.260
What's wrong?

43
04:10.300 --> 04:11.100
Mr. Wei.

44
04:14.340 --> 04:14.820
I want to...

45
04:15.940 --> 04:16.700
go home.

46
04:17.620 --> 04:18.180
You will.

47
04:19.900 --> 04:20.940
You'll go home.

48
04:32.540 --> 04:33.220
Let's go.

49
04:33.820 --> 04:34.700
Back to Sheng'an.

50
04:49.020 --> 04:54.220
(Bright Spring Lights)

51
04:54.220 --> 04:54.620
Coming through.

52
04:54.740 --> 04:55.740
Move. Don't push.

53
04:56.060 --> 04:56.820
Move it!

54
04:56.940 --> 04:57.260
Hurry.

55
04:57.980 --> 04:58.340
Stop!

56
04:59.580 --> 04:59.980
Stop.

57
05:01.380 --> 05:01.780
Stop!

58
05:02.340 --> 05:03.060
Put that down!

59
05:03.660 --> 05:04.020
Stop.

60
05:04.980 --> 05:05.820
- My treasure! - Put it down.

61
05:06.180 --> 05:06.500
Stop.

62
05:07.660 --> 05:08.060
(Bright Spring Lights) Put it down!

63
05:09.060 --> 05:10.340
- Her Highness always treated you well. - Let me go!

64
05:10.820 --> 05:11.420
How could you...

65
05:11.820 --> 05:12.700
- This is mine! - Let him go.

66
05:15.260 --> 05:15.700
Go.

67
05:24.660 --> 05:25.700
Gathered for profit.

68
05:27.380 --> 05:27.940
Scattered

69
05:30.020 --> 05:31.060
when profit runs out.

70
05:34.500 --> 05:34.940
And you?

71
05:36.420 --> 05:37.140
Why aren't you leaving?

72
05:39.380 --> 05:40.500
Your Highness, you honored your old ties

73
05:42.180 --> 05:43.900
and dared to keep vigil for Yu Cheng'an.

74
05:45.180 --> 05:45.700
I admire you for that.

75
05:46.700 --> 05:48.860
I have studied the sages.

76
05:49.500 --> 05:50.340
I've already lost my sense of shame.

77
05:51.740 --> 05:52.780
How could I abandon propriety and righteousness as well?

78
06:26.620 --> 06:29.620
This mountain is mine, and these trees are mine!

79
06:31.260 --> 06:31.660
Who goes there?

80
06:32.100 --> 06:33.180
How dare you block a Sheng'an carriage?

81
06:33.660 --> 06:34.300
Stand aside!

82
06:35.420 --> 06:35.860
Move!

83
06:40.060 --> 06:40.580
Miss Zhao?

84
06:42.940 --> 06:43.860
You recognized me already?

85
06:44.660 --> 06:45.020
No fun at all.

86
06:47.620 --> 06:48.060
Miss Zhao.

87
06:49.900 --> 06:50.340
Give me a ride.

88
06:52.620 --> 06:53.340
Give me a hand.

89
06:56.140 --> 06:56.540
Careful.

90
06:57.740 --> 06:58.220
Miss Zhao.

91
06:59.700 --> 07:00.180
Miss Zhao.

92
07:02.380 --> 07:02.900
Miss Zhao,

93
07:03.500 --> 07:05.020
I don't know why you're here.

94
07:05.820 --> 07:07.460
But we really can't afford any delays.

95
07:07.860 --> 07:08.620
Please get down.

96
07:16.660 --> 07:17.500
Are...

97
07:18.260 --> 07:19.260
Are you about to cry?

98
07:23.140 --> 07:24.380
We earned the credit together.

99
07:25.380 --> 07:26.740
You get to be Pacification Commissioner and go to North Jing,

100
07:27.500 --> 07:29.020
while I'm stuck at home locked up by my father.

101
07:30.380 --> 07:30.860
Miss Zhao,

102
07:31.260 --> 07:32.020
this journey is dangerous.

103
07:32.340 --> 07:33.260
It's no spring outing.

104
07:33.540 --> 07:34.620
I know that.

105
07:34.980 --> 07:36.580
I've trained in martial arts, skilled in archery and horsemanship.

106
07:36.740 --> 07:38.500
Seven or eight ordinary men can't get near me.

107
07:38.660 --> 07:39.860
And with all the danger ahead,

108
07:40.260 --> 07:41.100
a scholar like you

109
07:41.260 --> 07:42.660
can't go without someone reliable

110
07:42.660 --> 07:43.460
like me.

111
07:43.940 --> 07:44.660
I can help you.

112
07:44.820 --> 07:45.580
I can serve the country.

113
07:46.300 --> 07:46.740
You

114
07:48.180 --> 07:49.340
ran away from home?

115
07:51.900 --> 07:52.660
I had no choice.

116
07:53.460 --> 07:54.860
My father was going to stuff me into a bridal sedan

117
07:55.180 --> 07:56.660
and shove me into the Minister's Estate.

118
07:59.460 --> 08:00.340
Just take me with you.

119
08:00.700 --> 08:01.940
I promise I won't be any trouble.

120
08:02.220 --> 08:03.420
Whatever you say, I'll do.

121
08:03.580 --> 08:03.980
Please?

122
08:05.340 --> 08:05.780
Miss Zhao.

123
08:06.100 --> 08:06.980
Take me with you.

124
08:07.620 --> 08:08.540
Just take me with you.

125
08:09.540 --> 08:10.580
I promise you won't regret it.

126
08:15.620 --> 08:15.940
Well...

127
08:16.900 --> 08:17.380
Alright.

128
08:18.300 --> 08:18.700
But

129
08:19.300 --> 08:20.020
we need some ground rules.

130
08:20.020 --> 08:20.700
As many as you like.

131
08:22.540 --> 08:22.940
First...

132
08:23.260 --> 08:23.820
We're off!

133
08:24.380 --> 08:24.740
We're off!

134
08:26.140 --> 08:27.180
Miss... Miss Zhao.

135
08:29.260 --> 08:34.300
(Lingnan Circuit, Santu County)

136
08:47.260 --> 08:48.540
Please, have some mercy.

137
08:59.940 --> 09:00.940
Eat up.

138
09:30.660 --> 09:31.140
Here.

139
09:32.380 --> 09:32.940
You eat too.

140
09:32.940 --> 09:33.580
Come on.

141
09:36.420 --> 09:36.900
Have a sip.

142
09:52.100 --> 09:52.580
- Smells amazing. - Dalang, you're here.

143
09:52.580 --> 09:53.060
(Huiji Rice Cakes) Long time no see.

144
09:53.340 --> 09:53.860
Dalang, come over.

145
09:53.860 --> 09:54.700
- Smells amazing. - Come sit a while.

146
09:54.820 --> 09:55.500
Morning.

147
09:56.220 --> 09:56.980
I'll come back for some later.

148
09:57.620 --> 09:58.140
Alright.

149
10:04.940 --> 10:06.380
Sir, you're not from here, so you wouldn't know.

150
10:06.740 --> 10:08.300
The mosquitoes here are bigger than anywhere else.

151
10:08.780 --> 10:09.420
This ointment...

152
10:12.500 --> 10:13.020
Xiaozhou.

153
10:14.020 --> 10:14.460
Shang?

154
10:15.500 --> 10:15.940
Shang!

155
10:17.460 --> 10:19.060
Dalang! Look who's here!

156
10:20.460 --> 10:20.860
Dalang.

157
10:24.460 --> 10:25.020
Shang!

158
10:25.940 --> 10:26.420
Shang!

159
10:40.940 --> 10:41.700
Strange.

160
10:44.780 --> 10:45.820
You've lost weight.

161
10:47.500 --> 10:48.180
How's everything at home?

162
10:49.340 --> 10:50.060
All good.

163
10:50.780 --> 10:52.100
Shang, let's go home.

164
10:52.300 --> 10:52.980
We're done selling for today.

165
10:54.620 --> 10:55.060
Let's go home.

166
10:55.460 --> 10:55.860
Let's go.

167
10:59.740 --> 11:00.460
You've really lost weight.

168
11:01.820 --> 11:02.700
Sheng'an's no good.

169
11:03.220 --> 11:03.900
Sheng'an's no good!

170
11:04.220 --> 11:04.620
Let me.

171
11:04.940 --> 11:05.500
Home is best.

172
11:06.540 --> 11:07.260
Home is best!

173
11:12.100 --> 11:12.740
- Father! - Father!

174
11:13.260 --> 11:13.780
Father!

175
11:14.020 --> 11:14.380
Father.

176
11:14.780 --> 11:15.940
Look who's back!

177
11:16.380 --> 11:17.460
Come see who's home!

178
11:17.500 --> 11:18.140
Who is it?

179
11:20.260 --> 11:20.660
Father.

180
11:38.860 --> 11:39.300
Father.

181
11:41.180 --> 11:42.180
I'm back.

182
11:47.820 --> 11:48.140
Come.

183
11:49.500 --> 11:50.020
Let me have a look.

184
11:54.780 --> 11:56.140
All in one piece.

185
11:57.100 --> 11:58.300
You're home safe and sound.

186
12:02.340 --> 12:02.860
I'm perfectly fine.

187
12:15.580 --> 12:16.020
Father.

188
12:17.260 --> 12:18.180
I've been away so long.

189
12:20.540 --> 12:21.820
I want to visit Mother's grave.

190
12:45.660 --> 12:47.760
(In Memory of My Mother and Younger Brother)

191
13:06.340 --> 13:06.740
Shang.

192
13:08.540 --> 13:09.300
Who is this person...?

193
13:18.340 --> 13:19.220
You're not mistaken.

194
13:25.580 --> 13:26.060
Father.

195
13:27.580 --> 13:28.580
His name was Zhang Renjing.

196
13:29.620 --> 13:31.620
I killed him like a butcher slaughters

197
13:33.580 --> 13:34.580
livestock.

198
13:37.300 --> 13:37.980
Good.

199
13:42.300 --> 13:42.980
Well done!

200
13:42.980 --> 13:43.300
Father!

201
13:43.620 --> 13:44.030
- Father. - Father.

202
13:44.030 --> 13:44.740
- Father. - Father!

203
13:44.740 --> 13:45.290
Father!

204
13:45.290 --> 13:46.580
- Father. - Wonderful!

205
13:46.580 --> 13:46.940
Father.

206
13:48.500 --> 13:49.860
Well done!

207
13:51.980 --> 13:56.160
♪A rough-cut gem, held close to heart♪

208
13:56.160 --> 14:00.260
♪Lean bamboo bones, yet mountain-bold♪

209
14:00.260 --> 14:00.620
Shang.

210
14:02.180 --> 14:02.940
You killed a man.

211
14:04.060 --> 14:04.940
How can nothing come of it?

212
14:05.780 --> 14:06.260
Father,

213
14:07.700 --> 14:08.340
to us,

214
14:09.300 --> 14:10.380
he was a mountain crushing us.

215
14:11.660 --> 14:13.580
He destroyed our family so easily.

216
14:15.700 --> 14:17.300
But to those wolves in Sheng'an,

217
14:18.420 --> 14:20.420
♪Winds gather, then drift apart♪

218
14:20.420 --> 14:21.580
he was nothing

219
14:21.580 --> 14:23.420
♪I see no court, only a boundless world♪

220
14:23.420 --> 14:25.100
but a worthless worm.

221
14:25.500 --> 14:30.100
♪In all I do, I have no regrets♪

222
14:30.580 --> 14:35.220
♪I gaze at high peaks and sails far away♪

223
14:35.660 --> 14:39.660
♪With the world in my heart, I leave the shore♪

224
14:39.860 --> 14:44.460
♪With rain ahead, I cross the pass♪

225
14:45.220 --> 14:49.260
♪Who'll wait with me for the boat home?♪

226
14:49.820 --> 14:52.160
(In Memory of My Mother and Younger Brother)

227
14:52.161 --> 14:54.660
♪By noon, the mist will lift; rivers will bend♪

228
14:55.100 --> 14:55.820
Jinghui,

229
14:55.820 --> 14:58.580
♪I'll take the open road and journey home♪

230
14:58.660 --> 14:59.300
Lun,

231
15:01.340 --> 15:02.060
Shang

232
15:04.380 --> 15:05.540
has avenged you.

233
15:05.540 --> 15:08.420
♪And trade my old robes for new♪

234
15:10.860 --> 15:12.180
May you...

235
15:15.740 --> 15:16.820
finally rest in peace.

236
15:18.100 --> 15:18.620
Mother,

237
15:19.700 --> 15:20.180
Lun,

238
15:22.580 --> 15:24.740
Shang has avenged you!

239
15:28.460 --> 15:31.940
♪Maze of schemes, endless dark night♪

240
15:31.940 --> 15:33.100
The Yan family took me in.

241
15:33.740 --> 15:34.660
You are my mother.

242
15:35.620 --> 15:36.940
Shang has slain our enemy.

243
15:37.420 --> 15:38.300
May you

244
15:38.860 --> 15:39.780
rest in peace.

245
15:42.260 --> 15:46.340
♪Drifting through twists and tides♪

246
15:47.340 --> 15:52.060
♪I gaze at high peaks and sails far away♪

247
15:52.380 --> 15:56.500
♪With the world in my heart, I leave the shore♪

248
15:56.660 --> 16:01.660
♪Dusk falls on the horizon, sorrow and joy stretch far♪

249
16:02.100 --> 16:05.780
♪A lone lamp keeps me company♪

250
16:06.820 --> 16:11.420
♪I gaze at high peaks and sails far away♪

251
16:11.740 --> 16:13.007
♪With the world in my heart♪

252
16:13.007 --> 16:14.760
(In Memory of My Mother and Younger Brother)

253
16:14.760 --> 16:15.860
♪I leave the shore♪

254
16:15.940 --> 16:16.340
Mother.

255
16:16.340 --> 16:20.180
♪Frost on my shoulders, joys and sorrows stretch afar♪

256
16:20.180 --> 16:21.780
I've avenged you.

257
16:21.780 --> 16:25.180
♪A thousand miles of lights keep me company♪

258
16:25.900 --> 16:30.740
♪By noon, the mist will lift; rivers will bend♪

259
16:31.060 --> 16:34.740
♪Today, lean on the rail with me again♪

260
16:35.460 --> 16:40.260
♪Tread the boundless clouds and rise with the wind♪

261
16:40.900 --> 16:45.980
♪March to the gates with fearless hearts♪

262
16:48.100 --> 16:54.580
♪Break every gate♪

263
17:21.580 --> 17:22.300
You little rascal.

264
17:23.580 --> 17:25.340
What's weighing on you that you can't tell me?

265
17:29.060 --> 17:29.900
A father knows his son.

266
17:30.460 --> 17:31.500
You may fool your brother and sister,

267
17:31.500 --> 17:32.180
but not me.

268
17:35.140 --> 17:36.100
You were granted leave to return.

269
17:37.340 --> 17:38.260
What's your real reason?

270
17:43.740 --> 17:44.220
Father.

271
17:45.980 --> 17:47.020
There's something important

272
17:48.140 --> 17:49.740
I need to take care of while I'm back.

273
17:50.580 --> 17:51.060
But

274
17:52.340 --> 17:53.020
it's no easy matter.

275
17:53.820 --> 17:54.540
I feel uneasy.

276
17:55.900 --> 17:56.540
I knew it.

277
18:02.620 --> 18:03.380
On my way back,

278
18:04.300 --> 18:05.740
I saw starving people fleeing,

279
18:05.980 --> 18:06.780
fields lying fallow,

280
18:07.140 --> 18:08.340
and folks barely scraping by.

281
18:09.300 --> 18:11.100
Has the government imposed new taxes?

282
18:11.700 --> 18:12.940
The officials in Lingnan

283
18:14.260 --> 18:15.740
are thoroughly corrupt.

284
18:19.260 --> 18:19.780
Could it be...?

285
18:23.420 --> 18:24.900
Shang, have you returned

286
18:25.780 --> 18:26.860
because Heaven

287
18:27.580 --> 18:29.620
has finally taken pity on the people here?

288
18:37.620 --> 18:38.060
Yes.

289
18:40.100 --> 18:40.700
But...

290
18:42.060 --> 18:43.060
That's how it is

291
18:43.860 --> 18:44.700
serving the imperial court.

292
18:45.460 --> 18:46.620
It looks glorious,

293
18:47.220 --> 18:50.420
but you're always risking your life and carrying a heavy burden.

294
18:50.820 --> 18:51.340
Right?

295
18:57.460 --> 18:58.820
When I was your age,

296
19:00.260 --> 19:02.700
I was just as ambitious.

297
19:03.380 --> 19:04.660
Devoted heart and soul.

298
19:04.780 --> 19:07.060
I'd have burned down my own house for the country if I had to.

299
19:07.700 --> 19:09.500
But now I'm old.

300
19:11.660 --> 19:13.220
Turns out I'm just an ordinary man.

301
19:16.100 --> 19:17.900
I just want to watch my children

302
19:20.060 --> 19:21.180
live out their lives

303
19:21.780 --> 19:22.700
in peace.

304
19:40.220 --> 19:40.620
Father.

305
19:43.380 --> 19:44.820
Back then, I had to go to Sheng'an

306
19:46.620 --> 19:48.180
and do what I had to do.

307
19:49.260 --> 19:49.740
And

308
19:50.820 --> 19:51.500
it's the same now.

309
19:55.540 --> 19:56.540
You have my support.

310
20:02.220 --> 20:03.900
I may be old,

311
20:05.340 --> 20:06.420
but I haven't forgotten

312
20:08.340 --> 20:10.500
the resolve I had back then, to face death without regret.

313
20:11.620 --> 20:14.220
You're better than I ever was.

314
20:18.220 --> 20:19.020
I believe

315
20:21.580 --> 20:22.700
you can achieve

316
20:25.060 --> 20:26.340
what seems impossible.

317
20:40.980 --> 20:43.700
(Taiji Palace)

318
20:43.900 --> 20:45.620
Why are you stammering?

319
20:45.740 --> 20:46.660
What's wrong?

320
20:47.500 --> 20:48.100
Your Majesty,

321
20:48.620 --> 20:49.580
Princess Danyang has been off

322
20:50.140 --> 20:51.180
these past few days.

323
20:54.260 --> 20:55.220
What's off about her?

324
20:56.180 --> 20:57.700
Since being confined,

325
20:58.220 --> 20:59.740
she's seemed unhinged.

326
21:03.820 --> 21:05.500
Tigers

327
21:05.740 --> 21:06.700
fear hunters.

328
21:07.500 --> 21:09.380
Hunters

329
21:09.820 --> 21:10.980
fear Mother.

330
21:12.140 --> 21:14.580
Mother

331
21:15.260 --> 21:16.460
fears tigers.

332
21:17.940 --> 21:21.340
Tigers fear hunters.

333
21:23.500 --> 21:27.700
Tigers fear hunters.

334
21:28.380 --> 21:32.020
Hunters fear Mother.

335
21:33.460 --> 21:35.380
Mother

336
21:36.180 --> 21:38.140
- fears tigers. - Tigers fear hunters.

337
21:38.340 --> 21:39.900
Hunters fear Mother.

338
21:40.140 --> 21:41.580
Tigers fear hunters.

339
21:41.780 --> 21:43.420
Hunters fear Mother.

340
21:43.620 --> 21:45.180
Mother fears tigers.

341
21:45.340 --> 21:46.900
Tigers fear hunters.

342
21:47.180 --> 21:48.700
Hunters fear Mother.

343
21:49.060 --> 21:49.660
Mother

344
21:50.340 --> 21:51.420
fears hunters.

345
21:52.140 --> 21:52.940
Wrong.

346
21:53.940 --> 21:55.740
It should be tigers.

347
21:56.020 --> 21:57.140
I got it right.

348
21:57.260 --> 21:58.500
I said tigers.

349
21:58.500 --> 21:59.100
Look at you.

350
22:00.060 --> 22:01.820
Mother, am I right?

351
22:01.980 --> 22:03.700
Are you afraid of tigers or hunters?

352
22:04.060 --> 22:05.900
I'm not afraid of anyone.

353
22:07.100 --> 22:08.140
My mother's the toughest!

354
22:08.900 --> 22:09.700
You're cheating.

355
22:09.700 --> 22:10.260
Fears hunters.

356
22:11.620 --> 22:12.660
Don't talk about Wanyao like that.

357
22:21.220 --> 22:22.220
Tigers

358
22:23.580 --> 22:24.300
fear

359
22:25.620 --> 22:26.580
hunters.

360
22:30.420 --> 22:31.420
Hunters

361
22:32.500 --> 22:33.180
fear

362
22:34.780 --> 22:35.740
Mother.

363
22:38.900 --> 22:39.540
Mother

364
22:40.820 --> 22:41.420
fears

365
22:43.540 --> 22:44.300
tigers.

366
22:48.740 --> 22:49.740
Tigers

367
22:50.580 --> 22:51.260
fear

368
22:52.540 --> 22:53.460
hunters.

369
22:55.420 --> 22:56.340
Hunters

370
22:57.660 --> 22:58.460
fear

371
23:00.860 --> 23:02.180
Mother.

372
23:03.660 --> 23:06.140
It's just one male favorite transferred away.

373
23:07.340 --> 23:09.540
She's been kept in the palace for a few days,

374
23:09.940 --> 23:10.980
and she's acting like this?

375
23:12.740 --> 23:14.820
What's the point of raising children?

376
23:16.060 --> 23:16.780
She knows

377
23:17.420 --> 23:18.660
she's my favorite,

378
23:19.540 --> 23:20.580
so she's using that against me.

379
23:21.620 --> 23:22.180
Your Majesty,

380
23:22.940 --> 23:24.900
Princess Danyang has always been your favorite.

381
23:25.540 --> 23:27.700
She must feel terribly wronged this time.

382
23:28.980 --> 23:31.380
Even so, she hasn't made a fuss.

383
23:31.980 --> 23:33.620
She's already docile.

384
23:36.220 --> 23:36.700
Never mind.

385
23:37.100 --> 23:39.060
Parents can't win against their children.

386
23:42.420 --> 23:44.140
Let her go back to her residence.

387
23:54.740 --> 23:55.580
Once you're back,

388
23:55.980 --> 23:57.620
you can finally get some rest, Your Highness.

389
24:01.180 --> 24:01.660
Fang Tong.

390
24:03.380 --> 24:04.580
Send word to the Eastern Palace.

391
24:05.340 --> 24:06.020
Tell them

392
24:06.660 --> 24:08.940
I'm inviting the Crown Prince to Cuiyun Tower to enjoy some music.

393
24:09.620 --> 24:09.980
Your Highness,

394
24:10.340 --> 24:11.140
word around the palace is

395
24:11.980 --> 24:13.020
the Crown Prince has crossed a line this time.

396
24:13.660 --> 24:14.980
His Majesty just showed you mercy.

397
24:15.380 --> 24:17.260
Are you sure you want to see him now?

398
24:17.500 --> 24:17.900
Yes.

399
24:18.340 --> 24:19.380
And I'll see him openly,

400
24:20.260 --> 24:22.940
for everyone to see.

401
24:24.180 --> 24:24.460
Yes.

402
24:59.380 --> 24:59.820
Wanyao.

403
25:01.100 --> 25:02.220
Weren't you confined?

404
25:03.060 --> 25:03.660
How did Father

405
25:04.260 --> 25:05.340
agree to let you out?

406
25:05.620 --> 25:06.540
Confined?

407
25:07.860 --> 25:09.300
Father kept me in the palace

408
25:09.900 --> 25:11.460
to celebrate Yu Cheng'an's death

409
25:11.980 --> 25:13.540
and honor Mother's spirit.

410
25:14.860 --> 25:17.460
Fine wines kept pouring in.

411
25:18.420 --> 25:19.660
I was drunk for days.

412
25:20.260 --> 25:21.540
I only just managed to get up,

413
25:22.100 --> 25:23.140
and came straight to see you.

414
25:23.940 --> 25:26.100
The Eastern Palace has offended His Majesty.

415
25:27.980 --> 25:29.500
What did you come to

416
25:30.420 --> 25:31.460
see me about?

417
25:33.460 --> 25:34.460
I heard

418
25:35.700 --> 25:36.620
that after the hunting grounds incident,

419
25:37.380 --> 25:39.980
you, Yang Si, and Meng Zaishi,

420
25:40.740 --> 25:42.580
a bunch of sword-wielding men,

421
25:43.700 --> 25:44.660
have aroused

422
25:45.340 --> 25:46.380
Father's suspicions.

423
25:47.180 --> 25:49.700
So right now, Meng Zaishi can't leave the palace,

424
25:50.220 --> 25:52.300
and you and Yang Si can't reach each other.

425
25:53.260 --> 25:54.260
Is that true?

426
25:55.100 --> 25:56.340
Even if it is,

427
25:57.500 --> 25:58.780
what's there for you to be happy about?

428
25:59.220 --> 26:00.900
When the lips are gone, the teeth grow cold.

429
26:01.620 --> 26:03.020
You should've understood that at six.

430
26:03.100 --> 26:04.380
Xun, what are you talking about?

431
26:04.940 --> 26:06.220
I come here with good intentions,

432
26:06.700 --> 26:07.860
and you treat me like dirt.

433
26:08.940 --> 26:09.700
You should know

434
26:10.340 --> 26:11.140
I am

435
26:11.500 --> 26:13.260
Father's favorite now.

436
26:14.180 --> 26:15.580
I can come and go as I please.

437
26:16.180 --> 26:18.140
I know you're in a tight spot,

438
26:18.820 --> 26:19.860
so I came to ask

439
26:20.500 --> 26:22.380
if you had any message for Yang Si.

440
26:23.380 --> 26:25.020
I'd be glad to deliver it.

441
26:27.660 --> 26:28.100
No.

442
26:29.580 --> 26:30.020
And

443
26:30.540 --> 26:31.860
I'd advise you not to stir up trouble.

444
26:32.580 --> 26:33.180
Xun,

445
26:34.340 --> 26:36.140
we just worked together to take down that traitor Yu.

446
26:36.700 --> 26:38.060
Why turn cold on me so fast?

447
26:38.460 --> 26:39.980
I'll put in a good word for you when I'm back.

448
26:40.740 --> 26:41.860
Once Father has cooled down,

449
26:42.300 --> 26:43.860
he'll remember your merits.

450
26:44.660 --> 26:45.740
Mu Wanyao,

451
26:46.700 --> 26:47.940
why pretend to be

452
26:48.540 --> 26:50.420
such a fool in front of me?

453
26:51.540 --> 26:52.740
I'll be frank with you.

454
26:53.420 --> 26:54.100
I've been back

455
26:55.100 --> 26:56.620
at the Eastern Palace for over ten days.

456
26:57.380 --> 26:58.540
I'm not confined,

457
26:59.340 --> 27:00.660
but I don't dare move around.

458
27:01.740 --> 27:03.060
The place is crawling with spies.

459
27:03.820 --> 27:05.060
No messages get through.

460
27:07.100 --> 27:08.460
Yet you openly

461
27:08.460 --> 27:09.860
sent word to the Eastern Palace

462
27:10.540 --> 27:11.460
and invited me here.

463
27:12.100 --> 27:13.500
You think he won't find out?

464
27:16.940 --> 27:18.100
As for you...

465
27:19.940 --> 27:22.060
You know perfectly well whether you're really living it up

466
27:23.220 --> 27:24.700
in the palace.

467
27:27.780 --> 27:28.940
Not just me.

468
27:30.100 --> 27:31.260
Shang has caught

469
27:32.260 --> 27:33.620
Father's eye too.

470
27:34.900 --> 27:36.060
He's been granted leave

471
27:36.940 --> 27:37.940
to return home in glory.

472
27:39.540 --> 27:40.500
Listen carefully.

473
27:42.500 --> 27:43.420
Right now,

474
27:44.620 --> 27:46.540
we're like lambs to the slaughter.

475
27:48.420 --> 27:49.740
Going to Lingnan is a suicidal move

476
27:50.980 --> 27:52.340
for Yan Shang.

477
27:58.300 --> 27:59.380
Xun, you indeed know

478
28:00.540 --> 28:01.660
more than I do.

479
28:04.580 --> 28:05.460
What's really going on

480
28:06.660 --> 28:07.620
in Lingnan?

481
28:21.620 --> 28:23.140
There are tigers in Lingnan Circuit.

482
28:24.420 --> 28:26.220
They'll swallow your pretty boy whole.

483
28:29.780 --> 28:31.940
(Qingning Pavilion)

484
29:02.960 --> 29:04.440
(Jifang Pavilion)

485
29:10.860 --> 29:11.300
Father.

486
29:14.980 --> 29:16.380
You seem in good spirits today.

487
29:17.580 --> 29:18.260
What is it?

488
29:18.780 --> 29:19.180
Your Majesty,

489
29:19.900 --> 29:20.820
early last year,

490
29:21.220 --> 29:22.420
I went to Mount Lufu by your command

491
29:22.740 --> 29:24.740
to pray for the two of you.

492
29:25.780 --> 29:27.420
Now that Yu Cheng'an's faction has been wiped out

493
29:27.500 --> 29:28.340
and peace has returned,

494
29:29.020 --> 29:30.100
your wish has been fulfilled.

495
29:31.340 --> 29:32.500
I'd like to go south again

496
29:33.060 --> 29:35.220
and fulfill your vow.

497
29:40.060 --> 29:40.500
Father.

498
29:41.940 --> 29:43.100
May I

499
29:43.540 --> 29:44.500
go to Mount Lufu again?

500
29:51.540 --> 29:53.940
Your devotion is so sincere

501
29:54.460 --> 29:57.060
that not even Lingnan's venomous bugs and miasma can stop you.

502
29:57.780 --> 29:59.580
How could I refuse?

503
30:02.820 --> 30:03.900
(Jifang Pavilion) Thank you for your grace, Your Majesty.

504
30:17.460 --> 30:17.820
Your Highness,

505
30:18.220 --> 30:18.860
the Crown Prince is really here.

506
30:31.620 --> 30:33.140
Your Highness, what an honor

507
30:33.620 --> 30:34.420
to have you here.

508
30:34.740 --> 30:37.180
We've been through blood and fire together.

509
30:38.540 --> 30:39.940
Things are different between us now.

510
30:40.860 --> 30:41.860
Of course I had to see you off.

511
30:42.860 --> 30:43.300
Thank you.

512
30:48.180 --> 30:50.260
You have enough troubles of your own,

513
30:50.860 --> 30:51.860
yet you still think of me.

514
30:53.340 --> 30:54.180
Yes.

515
30:54.860 --> 30:55.460
I am

516
30:55.940 --> 30:57.460
stuck in this city of sorrow.

517
30:57.860 --> 30:58.500
Not like you.

518
30:58.980 --> 31:00.300
You're a woman,

519
31:00.740 --> 31:01.820
but you get to roam free.

520
31:02.180 --> 31:03.060
Roam free?

521
31:05.100 --> 31:06.260
Don't joke around.

522
31:06.740 --> 31:07.660
You wouldn't want to go

523
31:08.340 --> 31:09.260
where I'm headed.

524
31:14.020 --> 31:14.660
Anyway,

525
31:16.580 --> 31:17.100
the road ahead

526
31:17.860 --> 31:18.860
will only grow

527
31:19.580 --> 31:20.300
more dangerous.

528
31:20.980 --> 31:21.380
Wanyao,

529
31:22.180 --> 31:22.700
take good care

530
31:23.380 --> 31:24.180
of yourself.

531
31:24.940 --> 31:25.340
I will.

532
31:25.980 --> 31:26.900
Thanks for your concern.

533
31:27.740 --> 31:28.060
By the way,

534
31:28.940 --> 31:30.620
did you bring the farewell gift

535
31:31.500 --> 31:32.060
I gave you?

536
31:33.300 --> 31:33.940
Don't worry.

537
31:35.100 --> 31:36.180
It's been safely put away.

538
31:47.300 --> 31:47.900
Safe travels.

539
32:07.340 --> 32:09.460
Father is using Yan Shang as a blade

540
32:10.660 --> 32:12.260
to strike down Lingnan's powerful men

541
32:13.500 --> 32:14.860
and strip me of my support.

542
32:16.420 --> 32:17.580
The Eastern Palace's funds for winning over

543
32:18.740 --> 32:19.740
generals and keeping troops

544
32:20.580 --> 32:21.420
came from Lingnan?

545
32:21.940 --> 32:22.380
Where else?

546
32:23.660 --> 32:24.860
Without real gold, silver,

547
32:25.260 --> 32:26.140
and iron supplies,

548
32:27.140 --> 32:28.300
how do you think I drive the men

549
32:28.300 --> 32:29.900
you saw at Cuiyun Tower?

550
32:30.380 --> 32:32.100
The wolves and tigers of Lingnan

551
32:33.180 --> 32:34.740
all sharpen their teeth and drink blood.

552
32:35.260 --> 32:36.460
Raw power beats skill.

553
32:36.940 --> 32:38.500
Yan Shang is just a frail scholar.

554
32:38.780 --> 32:39.660
He can't win.

555
32:42.060 --> 32:43.700
If you really can't bear to lose your pretty boy,

556
32:44.540 --> 32:45.500
then hurry to Lingnan

557
32:46.180 --> 32:46.740
and stop him.

558
32:47.580 --> 32:47.900
Wait.

559
32:50.580 --> 32:51.180
Take Yang Si with you.

560
32:52.180 --> 32:52.820
He can help.

561
32:54.060 --> 32:54.980
Yang Si is still

562
32:55.820 --> 32:57.140
under house arrest at his own residence.

563
32:57.540 --> 32:58.340
I'll find a way

564
32:59.020 --> 32:59.980
to get him out for a few days.

565
33:01.340 --> 33:02.260
Make sure

566
33:02.780 --> 33:03.620
you take him to Lingnan.

567
33:04.340 --> 33:05.140
That's my condition.

568
33:07.340 --> 33:07.860
Xun.

569
33:09.020 --> 33:10.380
You can't even be sure of your own fate,

570
33:10.940 --> 33:12.260
yet you still worry about Yang Si's freedom?

571
33:13.820 --> 33:14.140
Alright.

572
33:15.140 --> 33:16.100
I'll keep my word.

573
33:21.660 --> 33:22.260
(Wanyao.)

574
33:23.660 --> 33:25.540
(Yan Shang faces almost certain death on this journey.)

575
33:27.060 --> 33:28.220
(With Yang Si going with you,)

576
33:29.260 --> 33:30.380
(I can rest easy.)

577
33:36.820 --> 33:41.500
(Five Days Later, Jiangling)

578
34:11.860 --> 34:12.540
Where are we?

579
34:13.340 --> 34:14.500
Sir, you sure sleep soundly.

580
34:14.780 --> 34:15.460
We've passed Yichang.

581
34:15.660 --> 34:16.340
Almost at Xiangyang.

582
34:18.300 --> 34:19.220
Yichang?

583
34:20.260 --> 34:21.300
Aren't we heading north?

584
34:22.740 --> 34:23.060
Yes.

585
34:23.500 --> 34:24.860
The boat turned north yesterday.

586
34:25.540 --> 34:26.180
Where's everyone else?

587
34:27.340 --> 34:27.700
Over there.

588
34:32.380 --> 34:33.180
Where's Mu Wanyao?

589
34:35.260 --> 34:35.940
Her Highness isn't here.

590
34:36.220 --> 34:37.860
She knew you get terrible seasickness,

591
34:38.180 --> 34:39.860
so she had us take you north back to Sheng'an.

592
34:46.020 --> 34:46.940
(This trip has put me behind.)

593
34:47.500 --> 34:48.820
(Even if I travel day and night now,)

594
34:49.220 --> 34:50.540
(I'll still reach Lingnan later than her.)

595
35:00.460 --> 35:05.380
(Princess's Residence, Six Days Ago)

596
35:08.580 --> 35:09.060
Fang Tong.

597
35:10.180 --> 35:11.340
The Crown Prince

598
35:11.340 --> 35:13.140
is under constant watch by the Jinwu Guard

599
35:13.340 --> 35:14.140
and cut off from messages.

600
35:14.900 --> 35:15.860
How did he find out

601
35:16.380 --> 35:17.460
Yan Shang was heading south?

602
35:18.060 --> 35:19.300
Could His Majesty

603
35:20.500 --> 35:22.420
have deliberately let him know?

604
35:26.700 --> 35:27.620
Yan Shang faces almost certain death

605
35:28.100 --> 35:28.940
on this journey.

606
35:29.940 --> 35:30.780
And the Crown Prince

607
35:32.140 --> 35:33.980
probably wants him dead for sure.

608
35:34.700 --> 35:36.460
The Crown Prince sent Mr. Yang with us

609
35:38.140 --> 35:39.260
to kill Yan Shang?

610
35:39.740 --> 35:40.100
Your Highness,

611
35:40.740 --> 35:42.420
we absolutely can't take Yang Si with us.

612
35:43.180 --> 35:43.540
We will.

613
35:47.740 --> 35:48.220
Fang Tong.

614
35:48.660 --> 35:49.300
Faster.

615
35:49.900 --> 35:50.220
Yes!

616
35:51.460 --> 35:54.300
(Residence of the Prefect of Shaozhou)

617
36:05.580 --> 36:07.700
Mr. Yan, I should've welcomed you properly.

618
36:07.740 --> 36:08.460
My apologies.

619
36:08.860 --> 36:09.860
You're too kind, Prefect.

620
36:10.540 --> 36:10.820
Hurry up.

621
36:11.300 --> 36:12.620
Bring Mr. Yan a seat.

622
36:17.020 --> 36:19.540
(Liu Lan, Prefect of Shaozhou, Liu Wenji's Father)

623
36:19.540 --> 36:21.980
I haven't been to the capital in years.

624
36:22.420 --> 36:25.180
How are things in Sheng'an these days?

625
36:25.900 --> 36:26.820
This time of year,

626
36:27.340 --> 36:30.100
Sheng'an must still be freezing.

627
36:31.420 --> 36:31.860
Yes.

628
36:32.300 --> 36:34.940
Mr. Yan, you've come all this way

629
36:35.460 --> 36:37.340
to my humble home.

630
36:38.260 --> 36:39.460
What brings you here?

631
36:42.260 --> 36:42.980
Who are you people?

632
36:43.260 --> 36:43.660
Get back!

633
36:44.540 --> 36:44.940
Out!

634
36:46.420 --> 36:47.540
Get out now!

635
36:47.940 --> 36:49.140
We have an honored guest here.

636
36:49.580 --> 36:50.820
How can you let them make such a commotion?

637
36:52.620 --> 36:53.300
Sir,

638
36:53.860 --> 36:55.060
it's those refugees again.

639
36:57.500 --> 36:58.900
It's a time of famine.

640
37:00.140 --> 37:01.740
These are all poor folk.

641
37:02.540 --> 37:04.020
Hand out more rice and grain

642
37:04.500 --> 37:06.300
and send them off properly.

643
37:07.300 --> 37:08.540
No shouting or hitting.

644
37:09.340 --> 37:10.380
Yes, sir.

645
37:17.540 --> 37:18.300
Mr. Yan.

646
37:19.980 --> 37:21.780
What were you about to say?

647
37:23.220 --> 37:25.860
Actually, I'm here on your son's behalf.

648
37:30.740 --> 37:31.420
You are...?

649
37:33.300 --> 37:34.620
Prefect Liu, you don't know me.

650
37:35.180 --> 37:36.900
But back at the local school,

651
37:37.460 --> 37:38.900
Wenji always looked out for me.

652
37:40.060 --> 37:42.060
He misses you deeply in Sheng'an.

653
37:44.900 --> 37:46.460
This is a reward he received from His Majesty.

654
37:46.940 --> 37:48.060
He asked me to bring it to you

655
37:48.500 --> 37:50.180
and tell you to take care of your health.

656
37:51.340 --> 37:51.780
Also,

657
37:52.500 --> 37:53.300
there are some words

658
37:54.420 --> 37:55.460
he asked me to pass along.

659
38:03.500 --> 38:03.980
Prefect?

660
38:05.500 --> 38:06.620
A man with no roots.

661
38:07.100 --> 38:08.260
With no family to call his own.

662
38:09.380 --> 38:11.140
Liu Wenji has been erased

663
38:12.100 --> 38:13.940
from the Liu clan records in Lingnan.

664
38:14.500 --> 38:14.980
Prefect.

665
38:15.860 --> 38:17.420
Wenji was forced to give up his path

666
38:18.140 --> 38:20.300
to the imperial exams because of wicked men.

667
38:21.860 --> 38:22.620
He's suffered a lot

668
38:23.620 --> 38:24.620
in Sheng'an.

669
38:25.460 --> 38:27.260
Say no more, Mr. Yan.

670
38:30.100 --> 38:32.180
If he still cared about the Liu clan,

671
38:34.180 --> 38:36.380
he wouldn't be living on

672
38:37.260 --> 38:38.300
as a eunuch.

673
38:46.180 --> 38:46.780
Mr. Yan,

674
38:47.460 --> 38:48.420
is there anything else?

675
38:56.820 --> 39:00.460
(Residence of the Prefect of Shaozhou)

676
39:07.260 --> 39:10.940
(Governance Hall)

677
39:13.540 --> 39:14.660
Looks frail.

678
39:16.140 --> 39:17.180
(Serene and Content) But you've got guts.

679
39:19.380 --> 39:21.220
What were you thinking when you saved me that day?

680
39:24.180 --> 39:25.020
I was afraid, Your Majesty.

681
39:26.380 --> 39:27.643
Before I became a eunuch,

682
39:27.644 --> 39:29.260
(Serene and Content) I read a few books by the sages.

683
39:29.700 --> 39:31.140
I know that loyalty

684
39:31.500 --> 39:32.220
comes before all else.

685
39:33.380 --> 39:36.060
Your Majesty, you are the sun to every subject in Huai.

686
39:36.580 --> 39:37.780
I may die,

687
39:38.180 --> 39:39.700
but Huai can't go without its sun.

688
39:40.580 --> 39:42.580
(Serene and Content)

689
39:42.580 --> 39:43.660
Quite the smooth talker.

690
39:46.820 --> 39:48.340
How should I reward you?

691
39:49.740 --> 39:51.980
You've already made me a senior palace attendant.

692
39:53.020 --> 39:54.180
That's already an honor.

693
39:58.540 --> 40:00.180
So you've studied. Perfect.

694
40:00.580 --> 40:02.780
The post of Army Inspector is vacant.

695
40:12.860 --> 40:13.180
No.

696
40:14.260 --> 40:15.860
I'm neither talented nor capable.

697
40:16.420 --> 40:17.860
I don't deserve such a great honor.

698
40:20.500 --> 40:21.980
If I say you deserve it,

699
40:22.740 --> 40:23.820
then you do.

700
40:24.740 --> 40:26.260
Just put your talents to use

701
40:26.820 --> 40:29.740
(Serene and Content) and do something for me.

702
40:30.620 --> 40:31.820
That traitor Yu is dead.

703
40:32.060 --> 40:34.180
The Shence Army needs discipline restored.

704
40:34.860 --> 40:36.340
(Serene and Content) You may not know military affairs,

705
40:36.540 --> 40:39.100
but you've served in the palace long enough.

706
40:39.660 --> 40:40.700
You've seen plenty of nobles.

707
40:42.340 --> 40:43.500
(Serene and Content) Surely you can play the part.

708
40:47.620 --> 40:48.180
I...

709
40:50.500 --> 40:51.500
Can you play Go?

710
40:58.300 --> 40:58.860
I...

711
41:01.940 --> 41:02.340
Go on.

712
41:04.980 --> 41:05.340
Yes.

713
41:38.940 --> 41:39.860
(Do you not see)

714
41:41.260 --> 41:42.860
(the tide surging)

715
41:43.740 --> 41:45.100
(Learning without thought is labor lost) (to meet the sky?)

716
42:07.940 --> 42:08.300
One!

717
42:10.220 --> 42:10.620
Two!

718
42:12.660 --> 42:13.020
One!

719
42:14.980 --> 42:15.300
Two!

720
42:19.060 --> 42:19.420
Good.

721
42:20.780 --> 42:21.420
Very good.

722
42:23.660 --> 42:24.060
Two!

723
42:28.420 --> 42:30.820
No military merit at all, and he's an Army Inspector?

724
42:37.700 --> 42:38.820
Was that move supposed to be

725
42:39.500 --> 42:40.180
a hawk's flip,

726
42:40.780 --> 42:41.740
Army Inspector?

727
42:42.220 --> 42:43.780
I'll make sure all the men

728
42:44.500 --> 42:45.460
study your moves.

729
43:06.060 --> 43:07.220
I serve by imperial command,

730
43:07.820 --> 43:09.820
inspecting the army on His Majesty's behalf.

731
43:12.780 --> 43:14.540
General, is that "military merit" of yours

732
43:17.420 --> 43:18.660
meant to scare me,

733
43:19.900 --> 43:21.260
or threaten His Majesty?

734
43:41.220 --> 43:42.020
A fine blade.

735
43:44.540 --> 43:44.980
What a shame.

736
43:50.700 --> 43:51.940
You blind fool.

737
43:56.100 --> 43:57.020
Listen up, everyone!

738
43:59.620 --> 44:00.860
Anyone else who dares defy me

739
44:02.220 --> 44:03.180
will meet the same fate!

740
44:17.380 --> 44:18.100
(So)

741
44:19.660 --> 44:21.580
(this is what power tastes like.)

742
44:24.540 --> 44:26.380
(No point lying to myself anymore.)

743
44:32.420 --> 44:37.220
(Next Episode Preview)

744
44:37.300 --> 44:38.500
In a time of peace,

745
44:38.500 --> 44:41.180
he might have become a chancellor who could raise up the realm.

746
44:42.660 --> 44:43.900
But in times like these,

747
44:44.180 --> 44:45.460
he can only serve as a blade.

748
44:46.020 --> 44:48.020
Either one will crush the other,

749
44:48.420 --> 44:50.660
or they'll destroy each other.

750
44:54.880 --> 44:58.173
♪Be the ferry where you wait for the sun♪

751
45:00.858 --> 45:05.774
♪Be the blue silk that catches your tears♪

752
45:07.968 --> 45:13.813
♪Be the sleeve we held, worn by dust and years♪

753
45:14.313 --> 45:19.539
♪Let's conspire to grow old together♪

754
45:22.308 --> 45:27.099
♪Let me be a captive beast bound by the same lock as you♪

755
45:27.935 --> 45:34.014
♪- Through trails of mud and blood; - let grief drown in your eyes♪

756
45:35.815 --> 45:38.965
♪Soar with the wind; plunge into hellfire as one♪

757
45:38.965 --> 45:40.613
♪Burning bright as a song♪

758
45:40.665 --> 45:44.389
♪See how roses and green bamboo enchant♪

759
45:44.767 --> 45:49.433
♪Be the vow I make with all my heart♪

760
45:50.052 --> 45:54.093
♪If we say forever, then forever it shall be♪

761
45:54.584 --> 45:56.699
♪Not a single hour less♪

762
45:56.739 --> 46:03.685
♪However deep the snow, I'll wait if you're there♪

763
46:04.448 --> 46:07.901
♪We'll be gods above, or wandering souls♪

764
46:08.081 --> 46:11.226
♪In heaven or the underworld, you're all I need♪

765
46:11.665 --> 46:18.302
♪If we can stay, let's return to the village of our first meeting♪

766
46:18.699 --> 46:20.737
♪- May time be free of fear; - boats rock♪

767
46:20.737 --> 46:23.213
♪- May time be free of pain; - lights fade, seasons turn♪

768
46:23.251 --> 46:25.720
♪You're the only one I need♪

769
46:25.924 --> 46:32.811
♪Sharp winds or fierce rain, nothing can break us♪

770
46:33.123 --> 46:36.394
♪Be mine in this world; be mine in this life♪

771
46:36.699 --> 46:39.872
♪My last untouched innocence♪

772
46:40.196 --> 46:43.622
♪If only we could return to the village where we first met♪

773
46:43.855 --> 46:47.080
♪Stay by me; help me forget the frozen dream of last night♪

774
46:47.411 --> 46:54.207
♪Fireflies glow, flowers kiss our lips; just us, through dawn and dusk♪

775
46:54.576 --> 46:56.638
♪- May time be free of fear; - boats rock♪

776
46:56.639 --> 46:59.142
♪- May time be free of pain; - lights fade, seasons turn♪

777
46:59.189 --> 47:01.527
♪You're the only one I need♪

778
47:01.758 --> 47:08.593
♪By your side, through joy and pain, is that eternity?♪

779
47:08.942 --> 47:10.560
♪Till fireworks flood the town♪

780
47:10.690 --> 47:12.486
♪Till the lake is still and clear♪

781
47:12.843 --> 47:15.860
♪You're the only one I need♪

782
47:15.900 --> 47:17.227
(No animals were harmed or mistreated in production.)

783
47:17.227 --> 47:18.227
MkvDrama.net
